WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.053
This is Centaur.

2
00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:05.073
Every manager wants to see the numbers their own way.

3
00:00:06.188 --> 00:00:10.470
In Centaur, anyone can build their own dashboard, without asking an admin.

4
00:00:11.654 --> 00:00:14.814
In My Dashboards, Dana adds the tiles she cares about.

5
00:00:15.697 --> 00:00:20.318
Pipeline value, win rate, average deal size, the sales funnel, quota attainment,

6
00:00:20.318 --> 00:00:22.801
a rep leaderboard, and an activity heatmap.

7
00:00:23.239 --> 00:00:28.647
She drags them where she wants them, and the dashboard is ready.

8
00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:31.975
If the chart she wants isn't there, she builds it.

9
00:00:32.676 --> 00:00:34.983
She picks the records, say, won deals.

10
00:00:35.916 --> 00:00:37.172
Adds a filter, this year.

11
00:00:37.894 --> 00:00:39.972
Chooses how to group them, by industry.

12
00:00:40.683 --> 00:00:43.492
And picks a bar, line, pie or funnel chart.

13
00:00:44.203 --> 00:00:46.013
A few clicks, and it's on her dashboard.

14
00:00:46.598 --> 00:00:48.320
She can change it later, in place.

15
00:00:49.675 --> 00:00:51.037
Cody builds his own too.

16
00:00:51.534 --> 00:00:54.080
His shows his own deals and his own activity.

17
00:00:54.828 --> 00:00:59.764
Each person sees only the records they're allowed to see.

18
00:01:00.102 --> 00:01:03.759
For the standard questions, the Reports screen is ready made.

19
00:01:04.183 --> 00:01:08.135
Pipeline by stage, team KPIs, revenue by product, the forecast,

20
00:01:08.135 --> 00:01:10.143
and how each campaign performed.

21
00:01:11.306 --> 00:01:13.677
Click any line, and there are the deals behind it.

22
00:01:14.772 --> 00:01:18.762
And because every chart reads the same records your team works in every day,

23
00:01:18.762 --> 00:01:20.390
the numbers are always current.

24
00:01:21.292 --> 00:01:25.158
Nobody exports anything, and nobody keeps a spreadsheet up to date.

25
00:01:26.004 --> 00:01:27.113
Centaur CRM.

26
00:01:27.595 --> 00:01:30.034
Your numbers, your way, always up to date.

27
00:01:31.369 --> 00:01:35.430
Book a demonstration today, at centaurcrm.com.

